at "/demo/bottom-bar-skia"

// The web host gives a surface no touches, and on iOS the canvas takes the taps above the tab
// boxes (RN's Touchable.Canvas): the tap's 500 ms, its lift-point hit test and the posted tab
// are the Rust test's (gpu/src/bottom_bar_skia.rs). Here what the Contract holds.
test "the bar and its tabs are there"
  expect tree has "bottom-bar-canvas"
  expect tree has "tab-0"
  expect tree has "tab-1"
  expect tree has "tab-2"
